### Me - with cookie
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me

### Me - tampered token
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.XXXXX.YYYYY

### Search by name
GET http://localhost:3000/patients?q=amaka

### Search by hospital number
GET http://localhost:3000/patients?q=VC-0000

### Search by phone
GET http://localhost:3000/patients?q=0803

### Search - no match
GET http://localhost:3000/patients?q=zzzzz

### Search - too short
GET http://localhost:3000/patients?q=a

