### Check in
POST http://localhost:3000/visits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospitalNo": "VC-000001",
  "visitType": "new",
  "department": "gopd",
  "presentingComplaint": "Headache for three days",
  "priority": "routine"
}

### Today's queue 
GET http://localhost:3000/visits/today

### Queue for one department
GET http://localhost:3000/visits/today?department=gopd

