### Doctor writes the history
PATCH http://localhost:3000/encounters/PASTE_ID_HERE/history
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "historyOfPresentingComplaint": "Headache for four days, worse in the mornings. No visual disturbance.",
  "pastMedicalHistory": "Hypertension, diagnosed 2023. No known surgeries.",
  "examinationFindings": "Alert and oriented. Chest clear. BP elevated on repeat."
}

### Check in a patient
POST http://localhost:3000/encounters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hospitalNo": "VC-000001",
  "department": "gopd",
  "presentingComplaint": "Headache and dizziness",
  "priority": "routine"
}

